OL,3,GNEWSARain warning begins in England and
OL,4,AWales as Storm Boelo hits UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FStorm Boelo is bringing more wet and
OL,7,Fwindy weather to large parts of the UK
OL,8,F- a day after Storm Austen hit the
OL,9,Fcountry
OL,11,FA yellow warning for rain began at
OL,12,F11:00 in large parts of England and
OL,13,FWales, while a yellow wind warning
OL,14,Fstarted in Northern Ireland at 10:00
OL,16,FAmber warnings for wind in northern
OL,17,FEngland, Scotland, and parts of
OL,18,FNorthern Ireland begin at 21:00
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
